WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.020
Your team cannot inspect what they cannot see.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.922
And ceiling lights alone throw shadows right where the work is.

00:00:09.522 --> 00:00:14.805
Overhead room lighting sits behind the operator, so their own head and shoulders shade the work.

00:00:15.085 --> 00:00:18.171
Fine assembly, soldering and inspection all suffer.

00:00:18.771 --> 00:00:20.741
There are three bench lighting options.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:26.786
An overhead light fixture, with 2 or 4 lamps, tilts 10 degrees up or down to remove glare.

00:00:27.066 --> 00:00:31.705
A fixed tube light with a metal reflector spreads even light along the whole bench.

00:00:31.985 --> 00:00:36.874
An LED undershelf light attaches by magnet under a shelf or cabinet,

00:00:36.874 --> 00:00:39.607
and slides to the exact spot you need.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:44.805
Furnisys lights mount on Link and Flexi frames, and on Base riser shelves.

00:00:45.085 --> 00:00:51.125
Valve and gas-detector assembly lines we have equipped use them for gasket and solder inspection.

00:00:51.725 --> 00:00:54.211
Light the work surface, and quality goes up.

00:00:54.491 --> 00:00:56.369
Where is the darkest spot on your line?

00:00:56.649 --> 00:01:00.299
Comment below, and next, compare base and mobile cabinets.

00:01:00.899 --> 00:01:05.144
Furnisys: complete workspace systems, planned around your process.

